            fr("Julia", "For a fixed c, the set of starting points z₀ whose orbit under z ↦ z² + c stays bounded. It is connected exactly when c is in the Mandelbrot set, and is a dust of disconnected points otherwise.", "zₙ₊₁ = zₙ² + c,  c fixed"),
            fr("Tricorn", "The Mandelbar set: the Mandelbrot iteration with the complex conjugate. It has three-fold symmetry, with three ‘horns’ in place of the cardioid’s one.", "zₙ₊₁ = z̄ₙ² + c"),
