            fr("Celtic", "A Mandelbrot variant that takes the absolute value of the real part of z² before adding c, folding the plane and producing knot-like Celtic patterns.", "zₙ₊₁ = |Re(zₙ²)| + i·Im(zₙ²) + c"),
