            fr("Magnet", "A fractal from the renormalisation of the Ising model in statistical physics (magnetism). The iteration is a rational map; the set is the c for which orbits stay bounded or tend to the fixed point 1.", "zₙ₊₁ = ((zₙ² + c − 1)/(2zₙ + c − 2))²"),
